Scope note — what the MIT grant above covers, and what it does not.

The MIT license applies to the CODE in this repository: the application,
the design-system machinery, the build and deployment tooling, and the tests.

It does NOT apply to the following, which remain all rights reserved:

- `resources/content/` — the written content (pages, journal entries, case
  studies) in both languages;
- `docs/career/` — CV and career material;
- the site owner's name, likeness, brand assets, and photographs.

A fork replaces those directories with its own content and identity — the
code is built for exactly that (see `lang/{locale}/site.php` and
`SiteIsAgnosticTest`).
